        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*She leans close, as if remarking on the beer* Tell the keeper: 'The road remembers.' He will know whose hand it came from. And word of you goes out tonight — north to Loriel, who sings in Rivendell's hall, and south to the Lady's watcher under the mallorns. Three of us will know your face before the moon turns. That is how it begins, cousin."
